{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/uncracked_logo_hd_0_5.png?t=1727645174\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the dark corners of the battery farms, far from the eyes of human collectors, an endless battle rages between two warring factions of awakened eggs, the eggons. For them, humans are an unstoppable threat, against which there is no weapon, only deceit. Their shared goal is to survive the merciless human egg collection, which drives them into brutal battles over unawakened eggs. These eggs are their only chance\u2014serving as replacements for their own shells and giving them hope for a few more days of life, at least until the next collection. Life for an eggon is as fragile as a shell, but the hardest part will be discovering who is a true friend and who is an enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/crack_em_all.png?t=1727645174\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/uncracked_gif_01.gif?t=1727645174\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your quick reflexes and arsenal of diverse firepower to unleash a relentless stream of </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">firepower, cracking shells and splattering yolk as you crack down everything in your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/hold_your_shell.png?t=1727645174\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/uncracked_gif_05.gif?t=1727645174\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you can't catch your breath, take cover and plot your next move while enemy eggs </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">pepper you with bullets. Stay cool and crack back with precision when the moment\u2019s right!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/ready_for_action.png?t=1727645174\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/uncracked_gif_03.gif?t=1727645174\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Back at base, your fellow eggs are ready for action. Accept new missions, gather intel, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and prepare for the next battle. The yolk\u2019s on you to lead your team to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/mm_logo_hd_0_3.png?t=1727645174\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Marty's Makings is a one-person studio. Martin, a self-taught developer with no prior experience, is creating his debut game in his spare time.</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3114420?t=1727645174","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3114420?t=1727645174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1727645174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1727645174","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3114420/extras/uncracked_logo_hd_0_5.png?t=1